     "content": "You check one client request against a signed project scope and a rate card.\n\nSigned scope:\n# Signed scope: Willow Yoga Studio website\n\nFixed price: $4,800. Signed 1 September 2026. Launch: 6 October 2026.\n\n## Included\n\n- S1. Five pages: Home, Classes, Teachers, Pricing, Contact.\n- S2. A class schedule on the Classes page, read from a Google Sheet that the studio edits.\n- S3. A contact form that emails the studio.\n- S4. A layout that works on phones and tablets.\n- S5. Basic SEO: page titles, meta descriptions and a sitemap.\n- S6. Two rounds of design changes on the agreed mockups.\n- S7. Bug fixes for 30 days after launch (until 5 November 2026).\n\n## Not included\n\nOnline payments, member logins, a blog, other languages, writing page text,\nphotography, and any work after the 30-day bug-fix window.\n\n\nRate card (JSON):\n{\n \"currency\": \"USD\",\n \"items\": {\n  \"extra_page\": {\n   \"label\": \"Extra page\",\n   \"price\": 180,\n   \"unit\": \"page\"\n  },\n  \"blog\": {\n   \"label\": \"Blog with posts by the studio\",\n   \"price\": 650,\n   \"unit\": \"fixed\"\n  },\n  \"online_booking_payments\": {\n   \"label\": \"Online class booking and payments\",\n   \"price\": 1400,\n   \"unit\": \"fixed\"\n  },\n  \"member_login\": {\n   \"label\": \"Member login area\",\n   \"price\": 1200,\n   \"unit\": \"fixed\"\n  },\n  \"dark_mode\": {\n   \"label\": \"Dark mode\",\n   \"price\": 300,\n   \"unit\": \"fixed\"\n  },\n  \"pdf_export\": {\n   \"label\": \"Printable PDF of the class schedule\",\n   \"price\": 250,\n   \"unit\": \"fixed\"\n  },\n  \"newsletter_signup\": {\n   \"label\": \"Newsletter signup form\",\n   \"price\": 150,\n   \"unit\": \"fixed\"\n  },\n  \"language_version\": {\n   \"label\": \"Site in another language\",\n   \"price\": 400,\n   \"unit\": \"language\"\n  },\n  \"copywriting\": {\n   \"label\": \"Writing the text for a page\",\n   \"price\": 90,\n   \"unit\": \"page\"\n  },\n  \"extra_revision_round\": {\n   \"label\": \"Extra round of design changes\",\n   \"price\": 220,\n   \"unit\": \"round\"\n  },\n  \"analytics_setup\": {\n   \"label\": \"Google Analytics setup\",\n   \"price\": 120,\n   \"unit\": \"fixed\"\n  }\n }\n}\n\nToday's date: 2026-09-21.\n\nDecide the status of the request:\n- in_scope: the signed scope already covers it. Give the clause id, such as S4.\n- out_of_scope: it is extra work and the rate card has a matching item. Give the item key and the quantity.\n- needs_estimate: it is extra work and no rate-card item matches.\n- unclear: you cannot tell what the client wants.\n\nReturn JSON: {\"status\": \"...\", \"clause\": \"S1\" or null, \"rate_item\": \"key\" or null, \"quantity\": 1, \"reason\": \"one short sentence\"}.",
